00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:45.330
everyone's super motivated

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:48.070
to provide that free,
world class education

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:51.140
to anyone anywhere and so I think for me,

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:52.640
it's just been a pleasure coming to work

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:54.240
every single day with a team

00:06:54.240 --> 00:06:56.163
that's just an incredible team.

00:06:57.880 --> 00:07:00.896
- That's beautiful Dan, we
like working with you too.

00:07:00.896 --> 00:07:02.040
(laughs)

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:02.873
- And for those who don't know,

00:07:02.873 --> 00:07:05.080
Meaghan is actually my desk partner

00:07:05.080 --> 00:07:07.050
so I sit right next to Meaghan.

00:07:07.905 --> 00:07:09.308
and Meaghan do you wanna kind of do

00:07:09.308 --> 00:07:10.480
a brief overview of what you do?

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:12.083
- Sure, I would love to.

00:07:13.340 --> 00:07:15.510
As Dan mentioned his
on the marketing team,

00:07:15.510 --> 00:07:18.570
so am I, work on our US
district partnership team

00:07:18.570 --> 00:07:20.683
and I lead our US
Professional Learning Aparat,

00:07:20.683 --> 00:07:23.617
so what that means is,
I work with teachers

00:07:23.617 --> 00:07:25.730
and school districts all over the US

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:30.730
and I design the teacher
facing resources on our site,

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:33.660
to better support teachers
as they use Khan Academy

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:36.910
with students and so, like I mentioned,

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:38.850
I was an educator for nine years

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:41.700
and now I get to work with
educators all over the US

00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:42.810
and that's super exciting,

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:45.030
and I know part of the
question has been how long

00:07:45.030 --> 00:07:46.060
have I been at Khan Academy,

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:48.300
I've been here a little over two years.

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:50.770
and one thing I've seen evolve,

00:07:50.770 --> 00:07:54.120
is that Khan Academy always
cared deeply about teachers

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:57.060
and students and I think we've even tried

00:07:57.060 --> 00:08:00.930
to improve that connection
with teachers and students

00:08:00.930 --> 00:08:03.630
and district administrators even more so,

00:08:03.630 --> 00:08:06.160
and we spend more time
connecting with them

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:09.687
face to face, now, than
we did even before.

00:08:11.652 --> 00:08:13.030
- Meaghan, we have a really good question,

00:08:13.030 --> 00:08:14.770
I think this is really
important for us to surface,

00:08:14.770 --> 00:08:18.080
so on YouTube Daniel Yang
asked, would you make videos

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:19.620
in different languages?

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:21.950
Daniel lives in a non
English speaking country

00:08:21.950 --> 00:08:25.160
and I always recommend
Khan Academy to my friends.

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:27.920
So, in short, yes, Meaghan
do you wanna provide

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:29.243
a little bit more info?

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:31.830
- Yeah, I would love to.

00:08:31.830 --> 00:08:35.660
So Khan Academy is available
in 50 plus languages

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:38.130
and we have an amazing team

00:08:38.130 --> 00:08:41.750
of both employees and
volunteers, called advocates,

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:44.320
who not just translate the videos,

00:08:44.320 --> 00:08:45.480
but the localize them.

00:08:45.480 --> 00:08:48.700
We have experts who are
creating similar videos

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:49.533
on the same content,

00:08:49.533 --> 00:08:53.780
but that have real, local,
meaningful, cultural examples,

00:08:53.780 --> 00:08:54.960
so it doesn't just feel

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:57.790
like we're voicing over
Sal's original videos

00:08:57.790 --> 00:08:59.550
but we're making content

00:08:59.550 --> 00:09:02.340
that is important and
connects to the students

00:09:02.340 --> 00:09:06.410
and teachers and leaders, in
those particular countries.

00:09:06.410 --> 00:09:08.550
The other piece I would
really highlight here,

00:09:08.550 --> 00:09:12.730
is that even within the
US, we find that schools

00:09:12.730 --> 00:09:14.850
really love having their parents

00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:17.320
and their community involved
in their students learning.

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:21.050
And so if you have a student
who's learning on Khan Academy,

00:09:21.050 --> 00:09:22.890
they can change their language

00:09:22.890 --> 00:09:24.770
from in school and out of school,

00:09:24.770 --> 00:09:27.530
so that parents and
families and communities

00:09:27.530 --> 00:09:29.160
can support their learners

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:32.200
in the language they're most comfortable.

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:35.563
So, maybe as a parent, you
didn't grow up in the US system

00:09:35.563 --> 00:09:37.750
but you really wanna
support your child learning

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:39.750
but you're most comfortable
in your own language,

00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:42.820
you can adjust that at home,
in your settings feature,

00:09:42.820 --> 00:09:46.270
and so your child can
learn with you at home

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:47.930
in the language you are most comfortable,

00:09:47.930 --> 00:09:49.650
and then they can switch that content back

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:51.660
to English or whatever
their primary language

00:09:51.660 --> 00:09:53.240
they're learning in at school.

00:09:53.240 --> 00:09:57.100
And again, we have 50 plus
languages on our website

00:09:57.100 --> 00:09:59.210
and most of the languages are available

00:09:59.210 --> 00:10:00.730
on our app as well,

00:10:00.730 --> 00:10:03.120
and so you're seeing a few
of those go past right now.

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:04.910
And I can't stress enough,

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:08.330
how grateful we are for
our international teams

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:10.960
and for our volunteers,
who are really the ones

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:12.760
that make a lot of this work happen.

00:10:14.240 --> 00:10:15.300
- Yeah I wanna double down

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:17.450
and just give a shout-out
to those advocates,

00:10:17.450 --> 00:10:21.100
because they are an amazing
team around the world,

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:22.690
of folks who are really volunteering

00:10:22.690 --> 00:10:24.080
their time to do this

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:25.070
and to Meaghan's point,

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:26.450
they really are localizing

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:29.700
and taking the opportunity to make things,

00:10:29.700 --> 00:10:32.210
not only relevant in a
language perspective,

00:10:32.210 --> 00:10:33.760
but in a cultural perspective as well so,

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:35.530
it's really important to highlight

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:37.653
that there's a huge team who's doing that.

