00:25:19.230 --> 00:25:21.330
We, actually have an
amazing Khan India team,

00:25:21.330 --> 00:25:23.363
so, Meaghan, you wanna speak to that?

00:25:24.280 --> 00:25:28.180
- Yes, we have an incredible team in India

00:25:28.180 --> 00:25:32.390
and they are working on some
incredible teacher resources

00:25:32.390 --> 00:25:36.780
and scaling training to schools in India.

00:25:36.780 --> 00:25:39.600
And so, my first recommendation
would be to check out

00:25:39.600 --> 00:25:43.790
the Khan for Educators India
course that you can view

00:25:43.790 --> 00:25:45.610
anywhere on our India site

00:25:45.610 --> 00:25:46.790
and so I would start there.

00:25:46.790 --> 00:25:48.850
Our incredible team has put together

00:25:48.850 --> 00:25:52.426
some really thoughtful resources
about supporting teachers

00:25:52.426 --> 00:25:54.420
and learners in India.

00:25:54.420 --> 00:25:56.960
As we mentioned earlier,
we know that it's important

00:25:56.960 --> 00:25:58.690
not just to translate content,

00:25:58.690 --> 00:26:01.510
but to localize to the needs and culture

00:26:01.510 --> 00:26:05.370
and aspects of individual,
you know countries and areas.

00:26:05.370 --> 00:26:09.850
And so, a huge applause
to my teammates in India,

00:26:09.850 --> 00:26:11.390
and to look at that content

00:26:11.390 --> 00:26:14.950
and I would contact them if
there are specific trainings.

00:26:14.950 --> 00:26:16.740
I know they had things
planed for Impersiam,

00:26:16.740 --> 00:26:18.020
but of course with the pandemic,

00:26:18.020 --> 00:26:20.010
a lot of that has been put on pause.

00:26:20.010 --> 00:26:21.740
But I would take a look
at the opportunities

00:26:21.740 --> 00:26:23.680
they have there and it's really,

00:26:23.680 --> 00:26:26.833
really wonderful for teachers
and learners in India.

00:26:28.300 --> 00:26:31.950
